[[0,1257692,0,1,0,1,"2016-08-29T17:51:12","cynoclast","",[],"","Tens of Thousands of Infowars Accounts Hacked","http://motherboard.vice.com/read/infowars-accounts-hacked-prison-planet-alex-jones","whatever"],[1,6193581,0,0,1,-1,"2016-08-29T17:56:24","KosherHiveKicker","",[],"<p>....and by &quot;Hacked&quot; they mean Alex Jewnz sold access to his database to STRATFOR, or the SPLC.</p>"],[1,6193623,0,1,0,1,"2016-08-29T18:01:33","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/J6uan\">https://archive.is/J6uan</a> : \r</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Tens of Thousands of Infowars Accounts Hacked | Motherboard </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>'Tens of thousands of subscriber accounts for media company Infowars are being traded in the digital underground. ' </p>\n<p>'However, every record appears to have been included twice in the data, making the actual number of user accounts closer to 50,000. ' </p>\n<p>'The dumped data relates to Prison Planet TV, which gives paying subscribers access to a variety of Infowars content. ' </p>\n<p>'Vigilante.PW, another breach notification service, also has the Infowars dump listed on its site, and says the data comes from 2014. ' </p>\n<p>' That way, when one site is hacked and its hashes cracked, the damage will be largely limited to that one site. ' </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/CtXC0x.jpg\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,6193773,0,2,1,1,"2016-08-29T18:22:50","DillHoleBagHands","[e]",[],"<p>Ha, I would not trust Vice for a news source.</p>"],[2,6195888,6193773,0,0,0,"2016-08-29T23:16:01","gazillions","",[],"<p>Trudeau in Canada toured a native reserve and demanded that all other media but Vice stay away. Just in case the natives told him what they really think, I guess.</p>"]]
[[0,1257693,0,1,0,1,"2016-08-29T17:52:26","Mr-You","",[],"<p>I'm looking for a job in middle management. Need some material for rapport with my underlings.</p>\n<p>Collected so far:</p>\n<p>Other person: &quot;how you doing?&quot;, me: &quot;can't complain, well, I could complain, but who'd listen!&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;When I signed up for this job part of the job description was don't. trust. anybody!&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Must be those magic fairies that come in and do our jobs because apparently we don't do anything! [used when the bigger boss comes in and starts complaining]&quot;</p>\n<p>Don't make it too edgy though, I don't want to rock the boat.</p>","Looking for work friendly jokes that express \"I don't like this job.\"","","whatever"],[1,6193586,0,0,0,0,"2016-08-29T17:57:04","NeedleStack","",[],"<p>Unless you want to be regarded as a David Brent, don't use these jokes.</p>"],[1,6193714,0,2,0,2,"2016-08-29T18:14:53","Nofatpeople","[e]",[],"<p>&quot;how are you today?&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Ok, i guess. There is something wrong with my eyes&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Oh no, whats wrong?&quot; </p>\n<p>&quot;I just can't see myself doing any work today. &quot;</p>"],[2,6197414,6193714,1,0,1,"2016-08-30T02:35:12","Mr-You","",[],"<p>Perfect! Can't wait to try this out on that guy who looks like he wants to shoot up the place.</p>"],[1,6195521,0,1,0,1,"2016-08-29T22:21:29","1Icemonkey","",[],"<p>Just play the old song, &quot;Take This Job and Shove It&quot;</p>"]]
