[[0,1257695,0,3,0,3,"2016-08-29T17:53:00","salvia_d","",[],"","Hillary's Boogeymen... (Ben Garrison cartoon)","http://grrrgraphics.com/cartoons/hillarys-nightmare","politics"],[1,6193605,0,20,0,20,"2016-08-29T17:59:16","pornhub_katie","",[],"<p>That's a dank pepe. </p>"],[1,6193717,0,10,0,10,"2016-08-29T18:15:16","oddjob","",[],"<p>I wonder how many people went to those alt-right sites and decided that they weren't anything like what Hillary described.</p>"],[2,6193874,6193717,9,0,9,"2016-08-29T18:38:29","free2live","",[],"<p>A pretty significant number, I'm sure. </p>"],[1,6193730,0,27,0,27,"2016-08-29T18:17:11","Avnomke","",[],"<p>Is that Harambe in a MAGA hat?</p>"],[2,6194754,6193730,2,0,2,"2016-08-29T20:35:09","bikergang_accountant","",[],"<p>Or it's russled jimmies gorilla,</p>"],[1,6193949,0,11,0,11,"2016-08-29T18:49:02","newoldwave","",[],"<p>Garrison is getting better and better.</p>"],[1,6194240,0,7,0,7,"2016-08-29T19:33:08","SeemsReasonable","",[],"<p>So far Ben has been spot on with all of his political cartoons I've seen him put out in the past year. I heard of him first on here around the time I joined, scrolling through a comment section of one of the first cartoons of his I saw and people back then on here were saying how terrible and racist and this and that he was and how his cartoon was bad and he should feel bad.</p>\n<p>First thing I did after reading that was look up more of his political cartoons and saw how he was speaking the truth many don't want to hear and near instantly became a fan. I can't think of a single one he's done that has been posted on here in the past year I did not like and every time I see his work posted here I'm looking forward to clicking the link to a quality and truthful submission.</p>"],[2,6195146,6194240,3,0,3,"2016-08-29T21:34:15","pinkmagnet","",[],"<p>People on voat were saying Zyklon Ben had racist cartoons? That sounds more like something the people at eddit would do. As far as I recall Ben has always been celebrated here at voat.</p>"],[1,6194304,0,2,0,2,"2016-08-29T19:40:38","Black_Phillip","",[],"<p>God damn that's amazing</p>"],[1,6194418,0,1,0,1,"2016-08-29T19:55:17","fluxusp","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://i.sli.mg/EfUD1h.jpg\">https://i.sli.mg/EfUD1h.jpg</a></p>"],[1,6194543,0,1,0,1,"2016-08-29T20:07:11","1Sorry_SOB","",[],"<p>That is sooo incisive.</p>"],[1,6194720,0,9,0,9,"2016-08-29T20:30:00","Big_Amish","",[],"<p>He put Pepe in it. The absolute madman.</p>"],[2,6194824,6194720,4,0,4,"2016-08-29T20:45:14","Narikonus","",[],"<p>Uh, that's a nazi frog, not Pepe. Check your record, shitlord. </p>"],[1,6194774,0,0,0,0,"2016-08-29T20:37:24","bikergang_accountant","",[],"<p>There needs to be a commode chair in the room. <a href=\"http://www.arthritislivingaids.com/images/commodechair.jpg\">http://www.arthritislivingaids.com/images/commodechair.jpg</a></p>"],[1,6195218,0,0,0,0,"2016-08-29T21:43:08","damnittohell","",[],"<p>What does the T on the bedsheets represent?</p>"],[1,6196127,0,1,0,1,"2016-08-29T23:51:57","jinbnters","",[],"<p>Glorious, pepe and then Putin on a bear are such appreciated and fine touches </p>"],[1,6196447,0,0,0,0,"2016-08-30T00:44:56","PM_ME_UR_NOODZ","[e]",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>dat pepe</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Normies stop using my meme RRREEEEEEEEE</p>"],[2,6198000,6196447,0,0,0,"2016-08-30T04:06:04","EllenPaosEgo","[e]",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>calling Ben &quot;The Tel Aviv Terror&quot; Garrison a normie</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Ben goes to 8chan, and often posts threads of his political cartoons himself. He even talked to hotwheels and drew a pic of him.</p>"],[1,6196765,0,0,0,0,"2016-08-30T01:21:36","Analek","",[],"<p>This gives me the chills. Now I will have to check my nightstand for 4/chan every time I go to sleep.</p>"],[1,6196907,0,0,0,0,"2016-08-30T01:37:10","hunter3","",[],"<p>whats maga?</p>"],[2,6197787,6196907,2,0,2,"2016-08-30T03:32:49","stradian","",[],"<p>&quot;Make America Great Again&quot;</p>"]]
